        {
          "id": 566343929,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hi Graham, thank you for your feedback.\n\nThis dissector IEC 60870-5-7 is a security extention of IEC 60870-5-104 dissector.\nInstead of working on standard port 2404 It work on port 19998 and it can use TLS layer.\n\nFor now I would like to left this dissector as a separate dissector. In the future IEC 60870-5-7 could merge in IEC 60870-5-104 dissector. This extension of the protocol is not so used in the world, but I wold like to share the dissector with other software developer so they could find some improvement.\n\nI didn't understand the quastion about mysql.\n\nI'm sorry for the problems that you found but it is my first time of contributing to this software.\n\nLet me know how to continue to share this dissector with community. For now I would like to use it as a separate dissector end I wouldn't modify the existing IEC 60870-5-104 dissector.\n\nThank you for your time.",
          "author": {
            "id": 1731106,
            "username": "maurizio.greci",
            "public_email": "greci.maurizio@gmail.com",
            "name": "Maurizio Greci",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/61cad0185f33db11283e5a5ac974d21dbc4fdfa88a487ead29a66ae89c77e540?s=80&d=identicon",
